    {
      "source": "Return a tailored <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> built using the given parameter values and considering\n<a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>expression dependencies</code></a>. The returned <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> may contain a\nreduced visibility of methods and properties/fields according to the required <a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>expression dependencies</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个使用给定参数值构建的、并考虑了<a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>表达式依赖项</code></a>的定制<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。返回的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>可能根据所需的<a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>表达式依赖项</code></a>，对方法和属性/字段的可见性进行了缩减。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "Return a tailored <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> built using the given parameter values and considering\n<a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>expression dependencies</code></a>.",
      "translation": "返回一个使用给定参数值构建的、并考虑了<a href=\"../spel/ExpressionDependencies.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.spel\"><code>表达式依赖项</code></a>的定制<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.expression 中的类或接口\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "SPI to provide to access a centrally defined potentially shared <a href=\"ValueEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.expression\"><code>ValueEvaluationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "SPI 用于访问集中定义的、可能共享的<a href=\"ValueEvaluationContext.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.expression 中的接口\"><code>ValueEvaluationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>dependencies</code> - the requested expression dependencies to be available.",
